_Maya%20isotipo%20SVG.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="maya-brand-movil"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e99_Maya%20imagotipo%20SVG.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="maya-brand"/></a><div id="menu-button" class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="menu_lottie" data-w-id="07e21b85-6246-ebc4-0ac3-f90ca30f6ae9" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6626aed7dec06b5cfa7bf298/663526e2376dfe119bedb591_lottieflow-menu-nav-06-ffffff-easey.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="2.36" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div></div><nav role="navigation" class="nav-menu w-nav-menu"><a href="/integrate-maya" class="navlink-menu-movil dinamic-color w-nav-link">Integrate Us</a><a href="/swap" class="navlink-menu-movil w-nav-link">Swap</a><a href="/ecosystem" class="navlink-menu-movil w-nav-link">Ecosystem</a><a href="/maya-academy" class="navlink-menu-movil w-nav-link">Maya Academy</a><a href="/cacao" class="navlink-menu-movil w-nav-link">CACAO</a></nav></div></div><section class="section hero"><div class="container hero"><div class="container__hero"><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 60px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="wrap-headings-hero"><h1 class="heading-1 align-center color-green">Your Go-To<br/>Cross Chain Solution</h1><p class="text-size-large max-width-32ch center">Revolutionizing native swaps and capital efficiency in a non-custodial way!</p><div class="hero__buttons--wrap"><a href="/integrate-maya" class="button-link primary w-inline-block"><div class="button-text">Start with Maya</div></a><a href="/integrate-us#get-in-touch" class="button-link secondary w-inline-block"><div class="button-text secondary">Get in touch</div></a></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66f45893607481d9daad4101_ETH%20coin%203D.webp" alt="ETH Coin 3D" style="opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(31deg) rotateY(-19deg) rotateZ(49deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(31deg) rotateY(-19deg) rotateZ(49deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(31deg) rotateY(-19deg) rotateZ(49deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(31deg) rotateY(-19deg) rotateZ(49deg) skew(0, 0);transform-style:preserve-3d" class="coin-hero-bg eth"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66f45893775c7fbfee9c6231_BTC%20Coin%203D.webp" alt="BTC Con 3D" style="opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(37px, 70px, null) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(37px, 70px, null) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(37px, 70px, null) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(37px, 70px, null) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform-style:preserve-3d" class="coin-hero-bg btc"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/674f2f2b9c309a1d5fe9873e_CACAO%20Coin%401-1482x915.avif" alt="CACAO Coin" style="opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(25deg) rotateY(null) rotateZ(25deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(25deg) rotateY(null) rotateZ(25deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(25deg) rotateY(null) rotateZ(25deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(25deg) rotateY(null) rotateZ(25deg) skew(0, 0);transform-style:preserve-3d" class="coin-hero-cacao"/></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73eb6_Vector%20lines%20thin.svg" alt="Background lines Maya" style="opacity:0" class="maya__lines--thin"/><div class="light__up__right"></div><div class="light__center-hero"></div></section><div class="section"><div data-w-id="10aa9285-bb1d-2b47-393d-6cb5361ba321" class="container-spline-section"><div class="heading-spline-section"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e9a_Maya%20protocol%20SVG.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Maya protocol logo" class="img-maya-protocol"/><p class="text-size-small">Powered by CosmosSDK</p><p data-w-id="adbc92db-f37b-a9d4-5e66-23c6e47b3ebf" class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">Break up with your CEX. Meet Maya Protocol一your new cross-chain trading partner. Revolutionizing decentralized trading and capital efficiency. No more wrapped tokens. Just pure, native assets.	<br/></p><ul data-w-id="8cb0c25b-d6a0-fadc-191e-67b986e93c81" role="list" class="list"><li class="list-item none-bullet"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">What can you do with Maya?</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a trader: Swap native assets / Swap natively across any chain. Any time. With the best rat</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a liquidity provider: Earn rewards on your crypto.</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a user interface: integrate Maya for seamless swaps and earn from fees.</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">All of this in a: PERMISSIONLESS, ONCHAIN, NONCUSTODIAL, MULTICHAIN, and SECURE way.<br/>Trade freely.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-w-id="6eb306cd-098b-7585-1990-a9115f8ca706" class="block-quote">We are an Automated Market Maker: Uniswap, but cross-chain! We bring DeFi to Bitcoin. We bring back permissionless to Blockchain!</blockquote></div><div id="w-node-_6f0304b5-5638-0ccf-5b3a-a70e2b4d470b-98e31b63" class="wrapper-coins-spline"><div data-w-id="eaf03ace-93b7-c4f2-16d1-55782ab13098" style="opacity:0" class="spline-crypto-coins" data-animation-type="spline" data-spline-url="https://prod.spline.design/CGF4WW70eCofKmdo/scene.splinecode"><canvas></canvas></div></div></div></div><section class="section description display-none"><div class="spline-crypto-coins" data-w-id="91596ca9-db65-d8c3-0616-50b312815877" data-animation-type="spline" data-spline-url="https://prod.spline.design/CGF4WW70eCofKmdo/scene.splinecode"><canvas></canvas></div><div class="container maya__protocol is-large-vh"><div class="container__column description sticky"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e9a_Maya%20protocol%20SVG.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Maya protocol logo" class="img-maya-protocol"/><p class="text-size-small">Powered by CosmosSDK</p><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">Break up with your CEX. Meet Maya Protocol一your new cross-chain trading partner. Revolutionizing decentralized trading and capital efficiency. No more wrapped tokens. Just pure, native assets.	<br/></p><ul role="list" class="list"><li class="list-item none-bullet"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">What can you do with Maya?</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a trader: Swap native assets / Swap natively across any chain. Any time. With the best rat</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a liquidity provider: Earn rewards on your crypto.</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">As a user interface: integrate Maya for seamless swaps and earn from fees.</p></li><li class="list-item"><p class="text-size-regular text-wrap-pretty">All of this in a: PERMISSIONLESS, ONCHAIN, NONCUSTODIAL, MULTICHAIN, and SECURE way.<br/>Trade freely.</p></li></ul><blockquote class="block-quote">We are an Automated Market Maker: Uniswap, but cross-chain! We bring DeFi to Bitcoin. We bring back permissionless to Blockchain!</blockquote></div><div class="light__center__left"></div></div></section><section data-w-id="3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd3c" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 80px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 80px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 80px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 80px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="section stats"><div class="container w-clearfix"><div class="w-embed w-script"><!-- Script Maya statics -->
<script defer>
  async function fetchMetaData() {
    try {
      const response = await fetch(
        "https://midgard.mayachain.info/v2/history/swaps"
      );
      if (!response.ok) {
        throw new Error("Network response was not ok");
      }
      const data = await response.json();
      const metaData = data.meta;

      function formatNumber(num) {
        return num.toLocaleString("en-US", {
          minimumFractionDigits: 0,
          maximumFractionDigits: 2,
        });
      }

      const totalCount = metaData.totalCount;
      const totalFees = metaData.totalFees / 1e10;
      const totalVolume = metaData.totalVolume / 1e10;

      document.getElementById("meta-total-count").innerHTML =
        `${formatNumber(totalCount)}K`;
      document.getElementById("meta-total-fees").innerHTML =
        `$${formatNumber(totalFees)}`;
      /*
       total volume hide document.getElementById("meta-total-volume").innerHTML =
        `${formatNumber(totalVolume)}`;
       */
    } catch (error) {
      document.getElementById("meta-data").innerHTML = `Error: ${error.message}`;
    }
  }

  async function fetchCacaoValue() {
    try {
      const response = await fetch("https://midgard.mayachain.info/v2/history/tvl");
      if (!response.ok) {
        throw new Error("Network response was not ok");
      }
      const data = await response.json();
      const intervalData = data.intervals[0];

      function formatNumber(num) {
        return num.toLocaleString("en-US", {
          minimumFractionDigits: 0,
          maximumFractionDigits: 2,
        });
      }

      const totalValuePooled = intervalData.totalValuePooled / 1e10;
      const cacaoPriceUSD = parseFloat(intervalData.cacaoPriceUSD);
      const totalValueInCacao = totalValuePooled * cacaoPriceUSD;

      document.getElementById("cacao-total-value-pooled").innerHTML =
        `$${formatNumber(totalValuePooled)}`;
      document.getElementById("cacao-total-value-in-cacao").innerHTML =
        `$${formatNumber(totalValueInCacao)}`;
    } catch (error) {
      document.getElementById("cacao-value").innerHTML = `Error: ${error.message}`;
    }
  }

  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
    fetchMetaData();
    fetchCacaoValue();

    setInterval(fetchMetaData, 60000); // Actualiza cada 60 segundos
    setInterval(fetchCacaoValue, 60000); // Actualiza cada 60 segundos
  });
</script></div><h2 class="heading-2">Maya stats</h2><div id="meta-data-edit" class="data-box"><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd41-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div id="meta-total-volume" style="opacity:0" class="data-item">$748,267,434.67</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">1-Year Volume</div></div><div class="data-wrapper"><div id="meta-total-fees" style="opacity:0" class="data-item"></div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Total Fees Earned<br/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd4d-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div id="meta-total-count" style="opacity:0" class="data-item"></div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Swap Count</div></div><div class="data-wrapper"><div id="cacao-total-value-pooled" style="opacity:0" class="data-item"></div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Total Value Pooled</div></div><div class="data-wrapper"><div id="Edit-cacao-total-value-in-cacao" style="opacity:0" class="data-item"></div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Total Value in Cacao (USD)</div></div></div><div id="meta-data" class="data-box-hard-code"><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd5e-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div style="opacity:0" class="data-item">$748,267,434.67</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Yearly volume</div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd64-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div style="opacity:0" class="data-item">$3,030,550.74</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Yearly Fees Earned<br/></div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd6b-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div style="opacity:0" class="data-item">671,020</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Yearly swaps</div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd71-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div id="cacao-total-value-in-cacao" style="opacity:0" class="data-item"></div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Total Value Locked</div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd76-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div style="opacity:0" class="data-item">1,488</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Liquidity Providers</div></div><div id="w-node-_3048888b-234b-3550-55fd-afaf99d7bd7c-98e31b63" class="data-wrapper"><div style="opacity:0" class="data-item">26</div><div style="width:0%" class="line-division green"></div><div class="text-size-large">Pools</div></div><div class="code-embed-dinamic-gradient w-embed"><style>
