t="_blank" class="bento-item-app toolkit w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73f21_TK%20gitbook.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Gitbook logo" class="image-ecosystem"/><p class="text-size-small">Gitbook</p><div class="light__hover toolkit"></div></a><a id="w-node-e7aa9af3-3234-a5e1-4810-62e7e77207cb-98e31b63" href="https://gitlab.com/mayachain/mayanode" target="_blank" class="bento-item-app toolkit w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73f2f_TK%20Gitlab.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Gitlab logo" class="image-ecosystem"/><p class="text-size-small">Gitlab</p><div class="light__hover toolkit"></div></a><a href="https://xchainjs.org/" target="_blank" class="bento-item-app toolkit w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73f24_TK%20XC.svg" loading="lazy" alt="XChain logo" class="image-ecosystem"/><p class="text-size-small">XChainJS</p><div class="light__hover toolkit"></div></a><a href="https://swapkit.dev/" target="_blank" class="bento-item-app toolkit w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73f22_TK%20Swapkit.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Swapkit Logo" class="image-ecosystem"/><p class="text-size-small">Swapkit</p><div class="light__hover toolkit"></div></a><div id="w-node-e7aa9af3-3234-a5e1-4810-62e7e77207da-98e31b63" style="border-color:rgba(29,60,165,0.4)" class="bento-item-heading toolkit"><h3 class="heading-3">Toolkit</h3><p class="text-size-small toolkit">Tools to help you integrate Maya Protocol for your wallet or interface!</p><div style="opacity:0" class="light__hover toolkit heading"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section benefits"><div class="container"><h5 class="heading-3 centered">Unlock the Power of True Decentralization</h5><div class="w-embed w-script"><!-- GSAP Library -->
<script>
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
    // Aquí va el código que carga los scripts de GSAP
    const script = document.createElement('script');
    script.src = "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.11.4/gsap.min.js";
    document.head.appendChild(script);

    const script2 = document.createElement('script');
    script2.src = "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.11.4/ScrollTrigger.min.js";
    document.head.appendChild(script2);
  });
</script>

<!-- GSAP script for controlling tabs switching with scroll -->
<script async>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", (event) => {
            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
            
            const triggers = document.querySelectorAll(".trigger");
            const tabSelectors = document.querySelectorAll(".tab__selector");

            triggers.forEach((trigger, index) => {
                ScrollTrigger.create({
                    trigger: trigger,
                    start: "top center",
                    end: "+=0",
                    markers: false,
                    onEnter: () => tabSelectors[index + 1]?.click(),
                    onEnterBack: () => tabSelectors[index]?.click(),
                });
            });
        });
    </script></div><div data-w-id="c61c2f56-090c-c5a8-c248-82b3b30a4e86" class="container-large-scroll"><div class="container-sticky-scroll"><div class="protocol-benefits"><div class="benefits-image"><img width="1141" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1141px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931beecae26885ba49537_Crosschain%20swaps%202.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931beecae26885ba49537_Crosschain%20swaps%202-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931beecae26885ba49537_Crosschain%20swaps%202-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931beecae26885ba49537_Crosschain%20swaps%202.webp 1024w" class="image-benefits _1"/><img width="1141" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1141px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931bf9577c619b903066f_Liquidity%20nodes%202.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931bf9577c619b903066f_Liquidity%20nodes%202-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931bf9577c619b903066f_Liquidity%20nodes%202-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931bf9577c619b903066f_Liquidity%20nodes%202.webp 1024w" class="image-benefits _2"/><img width="1141" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1141px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931be9ef4cd4249f085d5_Open%20Source%202.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931be9ef4cd4249f085d5_Open%20Source%202-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931be9ef4cd4249f085d5_Open%20Source%202-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931be9ef4cd4249f085d5_Open%20Source%202.webp 1024w" class="image-benefits _3"/><img width="1141" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1141px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931c0dc633c8e8fa6713f_Non%20custodial%202.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931c0dc633c8e8fa6713f_Non%20custodial%202-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931c0dc633c8e8fa6713f_Non%20custodial%202-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/68e931c0dc633c8e8fa6713f_Non%20custodial%202.webp 1024w" class="image-benefits _4"/></div><div class="benefits-information"><div class="tab__information crosschain-swaps"><h4 class="heading-4 gradient-blue">Crosschain swaps</h4><p class="text-size-regular">Transfer assets between different blockchains, seamlessly, safe and from everywhere in the world.</p></div><div class="tab__information liquidity-nodes"><h4 class="heading-4 gradient-blue">Liquidity nodes</h4><p class="text-size-regular">Nodes bond LP to secure the MAYAChain network and get rewarded in return.</p></div><div class="tab__information open-source"><h4 class="heading-4 gradient-blue">Open Source</h4><p class="text-size-regular">All code on Maya is open source and can be verified on GitLab. No sneaky backdoors.</p></div><div class="tab__information noncustodial"><h4 class="heading-4 gradient-blue">Non custodial</h4><p class="text-size-regular">Maya will never held or block your assets when swapping and does not require KYC.</p></div></div></div><div class="trigger _1"></div><div class="trigger _2"></div><div class="trigger _3"></div><div class="trigger _4"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section academy"><div class="container"><div class="container__blog"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e83/66bd404740a1fb5a0ae73e9e_Maya%20academy%20logotipo%20SVG.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Maya academy logo" class="maya__academy"/><div class="collection-blog-container w-dyn-li